{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Hides the native tab bar "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"type":"text","text":" signals "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to hide its overlay elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(selected tab indicator and top divider) in sync."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hideTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A view that hides the tab bar and propagates the hidden state to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" overlay items."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this modifier instead of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".toolbar(.hidden, for: .tabBar)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever a view inside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":" embedded in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" needs to hide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tab bar. Without this modifier, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot detect the visibility change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its overlay elements remain visible on top of the content. This helper must be used for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apps with nested views and tab bars."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise for simple app "},{"code":".toolbar(.hidden, for: .tabBar)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is enough."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct DetailView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Detail\")","            .hideTabBar()","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip\/hidetabbar()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip\/hideTabBar()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["SwiftUICore"],"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hideTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"hideTabBar()","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"SwiftUICore","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP14OUDSComponentsE10hideTabBarQryF::SYNTHESIZED::s:14OUDSComponents18OUDSSuggestionChipV"},"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSSuggestionChip":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSSuggestionChip","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSSuggestionChip/hideTabBar()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip\/hideTabBar()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Hides the native tab bar "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"type":"text","text":" signals "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" to hide its overlay elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(selected tab indicator and top divider) in sync."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"hideTabBar"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","tex